sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant API as GenerateDocService API
    participant Redis
    participant DB as PostgreSQL task store
    participant Outbox as Outbox dispatcher
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ via MassTransit
    participant Worker
    participant Engine as MiniExcel engine
    participant MinIO

    Client->>API: POST /api/v1/documents/async (engine=miniexcel, json to xlsx)
    API->>API: Validate request and map payload/template bytes
    API->>Redis: Reserve request fingerprint
    API->>DB: Commit task and outbox payload atomically
    API-->>Client: 202 Accepted with taskId

    Outbox->>DB: Claim pending message with lease
    Outbox->>MQ: Send GenerateDocumentRequested
    MQ-->>Outbox: Broker accepted message
    Outbox->>DB: Clear pending payload
    MQ->>Worker: Deliver generation request
    Worker->>DB: Load task and set Processing
    Worker->>Redis: Lookup generated document by fingerprint
    alt Cache hit
        Redis-->>Worker: Cached document metadata and artifact path
        Worker->>DB: Set Completed with cached result
        Worker->>MQ: Publish DocumentGenerated
    else Cache miss
        Worker->>Engine: GenerateAsync(json, optional xlsx template)
        alt XLSX template supplied
            Engine->>Engine: Parse JSON object and call SaveAsByTemplate
        else No template
            Engine->>Engine: Convert JSON rows and call SaveAs
        end
        alt Generation and artifact save succeed
            Engine-->>Worker: {requestId}.xlsx
            Worker->>MinIO: Save XLSX artifact
            MinIO-->>Worker: Artifact storage path
            Worker->>Redis: Cache generated document metadata and artifact reference
            Worker->>DB: Set Completed with result and artifact path
            Worker->>MQ: Publish DocumentGenerated
        else Failure after retries
            Engine-->>Worker: Generation error
            Worker->>DB: Set Failed with error
            Worker->>MQ: Publish DocumentGenerationFailed
        end
    end

    loop Poll until Completed or Failed
        Client->>API: GET /api/v1/tasks/{taskId}
        API->>DB: Read task status
        DB-->>API: Current task status
        API-->>Client: Status and download URL when completed
    end

    alt Task completed
        Client->>API: GET /api/v1/tasks/{taskId}/download
        API->>DB: Read task and artifact path
        DB-->>API: Artifact storage path
        API->>MinIO: Read artifact through IDocumentArtifactStore
        MinIO-->>API: XLSX bytes
        API-->>Client: 200 OK with .xlsx file
    else Task failed
        Client-->>Client: Display task error from status response
    end
